---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const title = 'Privacy Policy | 1rmaxcalculator.com';
const description = 'How 1rmaxcalculator.com handles your data: what we collect, what we don\'t, our cookie policy, and your rights.';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p><em>Last updated: May 10, 2026.</em></p>

  <p>1rmaxcalculator.com is operated by The Click Lab. We take your privacy seriously and have written this policy in plain language so you can quickly understand what we do and don't do with your data.</p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>When you use our calculators, the values you enter (weight, reps, etc.) are processed entirely in your browser. We do not transmit or store the numbers you enter.</p>

  <p>We use Google Analytics to understand which pages are popular and how visitors find us. This includes general information like your country, device type, and which pages you visited. We do not collect or store your name, email address, or other directly identifying information.</p>

  <h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>
  <p>We use Google AdSense to display advertising. AdSense uses cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this and other websites. You can opt out of personalized advertising via <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google's Ads Settings</a>.</p>

  <h2>Third parties</h2>
  <p>We do not sell, rent, or share your data with third parties beyond the analytics and advertising services described above.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>If you're in the EU, UK, or California, you have rights to access, correct, or delete personal data we hold about you. Since we don't collect directly identifying information, there's typically nothing to access or delete. If you have a specific request, contact us via our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We'll update the "last updated" date at the top of this page when this policy changes materially. Major changes will be announced via a banner on the homepage for at least 30 days.</p>
</BaseLayout>
